  "cli.usage.main": "Usage:\n  agent-server config init              Interactive setup for ~/.common-agent\n  agent-server config set provider ...  Configure a provider from the CLI\n  agent-server config set-key ENV KEY   Save an API key\n  agent-server config show              Show current configuration\n\n  agent-server chat                     Interactive terminal chat\n  agent-server run --prompt \"hello\"     One-shot chat (human-readable by default)\n  agent-server run --prompt \"hello\" --format json  NDJSON event stream (for scripts)\n  agent-server serve                    Start the HTTP SSE server\n  agent-server sessions list            List all sessions\n  agent-server sessions resume --id ID  Resume a session\n  agent-server sessions delete --id ID  Delete a session\n  agent-server tools                    List registered tools\n\n  Default config dir: ~/.common-agent\n  Override with --home; use --mock for offline debugging\n\n  agent-server config --help  More config subcommands\n",
